<!-- rtdf-block-id: airline/section1_non_textual:b0024; role: provision; provision-id: airline/section1_non_textual:p0022; source-lines: 106-128; relation: formalizes-preceding -->
```catala
```


1st and 2nd checked bags are complimentary for:
* AAdvantage Platinum® status
* oneworld® Sapphire members
* Confirmed Domestic First customers
* Confirmed Business customers
* Confirmed Premium Economy customers

<!-- rtdf-block-id: airline/section1_non_textual:b0025; role: provision; provision-id: airline/section1_non_textual:p0023; source-lines: 130-135; relation: formalizes-preceding -->
```catala
```


1st, 2nd and 3rd checked bags are complimentary for:
* Confirmed Flagship® First and Flagship® Business Plus customers
* AAdvantage Executive Platinum® status
* AAdvantage Platinum Pro® status
* oneworld® Emerald
* Active U.S. military and / or dependents with ID traveling on orders (1st - 5th bags free of charge)
* Active U.S. military with ID on personal travel

<!-- rtdf-block-id: airline/section1_non_textual:b0026; role: provision; provision-id: airline/section1_non_textual:p0024; source-lines: 137-143; relation: formalizes-preceding -->
```catala
```


### Weight and Size
We calculate the size limits of your bag by adding the total outside dimensions of each bag, length + width + height.

<!-- rtdf-block-id: airline/section1_non_textual:b0027; role: provision; provision-id: airline/section1_non_textual:p0025; source-lines: 146-146; relation: formalizes-preceding -->
```catala
```


For all regions, except to / from Australia or New Zealand, your checked bag allowance is:
* Dimension: 62 in / 158 cm
* Weight: 50 lbs / 23 kgs
* For First / Business, weight is 70 lbs / 32 kgs for complimentary bags and 50 lbs / 23 kgs for excess charged bags

<!-- rtdf-block-id: airline/section1_non_textual:b0028; role: provision; provision-id: airline/section1_non_textual:p0026; source-lines: 148-151; relation: formalizes-preceding -->
```catala
```


For all confirmed customers on flights to / from Australia or New Zealand:
* Dimension: 62 in / 158 cm
* Weight: 70 lbs / 32kgs for complimentary bags and 50 lbs / 23 kgs for excess charged bags

<!-- rtdf-block-id: airline/section1_non_textual:b0029; role: provision; provision-id: airline/section1_non_textual:p0027; source-lines: 153-155; relation: formalizes-preceding -->
```catala
```


#### Overweight Bags

More than one fee may apply per bag that exceeds standard dimensions for both weight and size. The higher fee between oversize and overweight applies, in addition to the checked bag fee.

<!-- rtdf-block-id: airline/section1_non_textual:b0030; role: provision; provision-id: airline/section1_non_textual:p0028; source-lines: 159-159; relation: formalizes-preceding -->
```catala
```


